        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/189964965?u=5e030a50f854f5d4d5c0c9e3e0d2599fe830e4f2&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">MDN uses American English spelling. \"Dependant\" is the British noun form; as an adjective it should be \"dependent\".</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Fixed in 8 pages (mostly the built-in AI API docs): <code class=\"notranslate\">LanguageDetector</code>/<code class=\"notranslate\">Summarizer</code>/<code class=\"notranslate\">Translator</code> <code class=\"notranslate\">create()</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">inputQuota</code>, and <code class=\"notranslate\">measureInputUsage()</code> pages, plus <code class=\"notranslate\">CanvasRenderingContext2D.lang</code>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Spelling-only change; no content changes.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44825",
