        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7352080?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Removing documentation of the <code class=\"notranslate\">offline-enabled</code> manifest key, which was supported by Chrome in Manifest V2 (Firefox and Safari never supported this key). The feature was marked as deprecated in <a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/25117\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/25117/hovercard\">WebExtensions - fix up all the tags except for apis</a> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1612323920\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/25117\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/25117/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/25117\">#25117</a>. Chrome ceased support for Manifest V2 in version 139.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #44817.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4919667433\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44817\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/44817/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44817\">#44817</a><br>\nRelating BCD changes in PR  <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4923775154\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30080\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30080/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30080\">mdn/browser-compat-data#30080</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44823",
            "title": "Remove the `offline-enabled` manifest key docs",
            "date_modified": "2026-07-19T17:55:15.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-07-19T17:53:34.000Z",
