            "author": {
                "name": "chigicherlachinmaya-arch",
                "url": "https://github.com/chigicherlachinmaya-arch"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91409429?u=4e1f7b62160e72ba743c04565340fd30f04e290a&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #44780.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4916588237\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44780\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/44780/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44780\">#44780</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The HTMLImageElement.x and .y properties are available for all images, not just those with display: table-column. Removed the incorrect restriction from both property docs.</p>",
