        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/259028460?u=76c93f0df0fbeb4706736acca78f07a43e398a63&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h2 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #44502.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4690779347\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44502\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/44502/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44502\">#44502</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR updates the CSS <code class=\"notranslate\">random()</code> documentation to match the latest CSS Values &amp; Units Level 5 specification.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">What changed</h2>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Updated syntax examples</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Replaced outdated examples with the current <code class=\"notranslate\">random-key</code> syntax.</li>\n<li>Updated examples to use:\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">property-scoped</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">property-index-scoped</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">fixed &lt;number&gt;</code></li>\n<li>custom <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;dashed-ident&gt;</code> combinations</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Updated parameter documentation</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Renamed the optional first parameter to <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;random-key&gt;</code>.</li>\n<li>Documented the current scope keywords:\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">auto</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">element-scoped</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">property-scoped</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">property-index-scoped</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Updated descriptions to match the current specification.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Updated description</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Revised explanations of random base value sharing.</li>\n<li>Updated examples showing:\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">property-scoped</code></li>\n<li>custom <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;dashed-ident&gt;</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">property-scoped</code> with custom keys</li>\n<li>automatic behavior</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Corrected terminology throughout the page.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Why</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The CSS Values &amp; Units specification has evolved since this page was originally written.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This update aligns the MDN documentation with the current editor's draft and removes outdated terminology and syntax.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Verification</h2>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>✅ <code class=\"notranslate\">npm test</code></li>\n<li>✅ <code class=\"notranslate\">npm run format</code></li>\n<li>✅ Markdown lint passes</li>\n<li>✅ Front matter validation passes</li>\n<li>✅ Local MDN preview renders correctly</li>\n<li>✅ Verified updated examples in local preview</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Screenshots</h2>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Updated syntax</h3>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/259028460/623140120-7d1618b6-eb9a-436a-93bb-132234ffc8ee.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODQ1MjU1ODEsIm5iZiI6MTc4NDUyNTI4MSwicGF0aCI6Ii8yNTkwMjg0NjAvNjIzMTQwMTIwLTdkMTYxOGI2LWViOWEtNDM2YS05M2JiLTEzMjIzNGZmYzhlZS5wbmc_.6qc9Iz_xSHCSjAGy46KLWk0OyXGbIsDqvA8PfuYGtJo\"><img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2026-07-17 14-53-56\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/259028460/623140120-7d1618b6-eb9a-436a-93bb-132234ffc8ee.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIs