        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF153 devtools now indicate heading level in the accessibility tools (tree and highlight). This adds a release note.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4743518021\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44578\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/44578/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44578\">#44578</a></p>",
