        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15844309?u=008f65848dd592799cd1d72033096baa1cbc88ce&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Replace the deprecated <code class=\"notranslate\">fred-server|ssr</code> command with <code class=\"notranslate\">fred server|ssr</code>.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The <code class=\"notranslate\">fred-server|ssr</code> command is deprecated: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4826749830\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/fred/issues/1697\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/fred/pull/1697/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/fred/pull/1697\">mdn/fred#1697</a>:</p>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/15844309/623040536-5db2d557-6ab0-4afa-b270-d71065e8bec1.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..1vm30pFEN2pgu1GA8YDbpI2Bk9uzOISphiG10G_zejI\"><img width=\"1011\" height=\"213\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/15844309/623040536-5db2d557-6ab0-4afa-b270-d71065e8bec1.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..1vm30pFEN2pgu1GA8YDbpI2Bk9uzOISphiG10G_zejI\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 213px;; aspect-ratio: 1011 / 213; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44757",
            "title": "chore(dev): replace deprecated `fred-server|ssr` command",
            "date_modified": "2026-07-17T05:24:37.000Z",
